/* A PollSlide deck is a SLIDE deck — 2026-09-08.
   Four of the five languages were translating it as a pack of playing cards:
     es baraja · fr jeu · pt baralho · it mazzo
   So the deck search box read 'Buscar barajas y preguntas' — 'search packs of playing
   cards and questions' — to every Spanish teacher who opened the app. German was the only
   one that got it right, by keeping 'Deck'.
   Standardised on the presentation word, which is what the object actually is and what
   the app's own 'Create Your First Presentation' button already says. German keeps Deck:
   it is established there (39 uses on the site) and German borrows the word comfortably.
   'Present this deck' drops the noun rather than saying 'presentar esta presentación'. */
